<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - PHILIPS H1 REVENUES/INCOME BY REGION.</title>
<headline>TABLE - PHILIPS H1 REVENUES/INCOME BY REGION.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips revenues</p>
<p>and income from operations by geographical region first half of</p>
<p>1997 in millions of guilders:</p>
<p>REVENUES -----</p>
<p>    Europe				29,820  vs  28,544</p>
<p>    USA and Canada		     8,346  vs   7,014</p>
<p>    Latin America			2,413  vs   2,216</p>
<p>    Africa				   126  vs     155</p>
<p>    Asia Pacific			12,303  vs   9,923</p>
<p>    Interregional sales     debit 19,622  vs  16,053 debit</p>
<p>    TOTAL THIRD PARTY SALES	 33,386  vs  31,799</p>
<p>INCOME FROM OPERATIONS -----</p>
<p>    Europe				 1,136  vs     385</p>
<p>    USA and Canada		 debit   8  vs	25</p>
<p>    Latin America			  114  vs     118</p>
<p>    Africa				     0  vs	 7</p>
<p>    Asia Pacific			   748  vs     708</p>
<p>    TOTAL				  1,990  vs   1,243</p>
